     5384               if temp_fbrrep-goods.is-not-office = yes
     5385               and temp_fbrrep-goods.is-waste     = no
     5386               and temp_fbrrep-goods.write-off-qnty - temp_fbrrep-goods.income-qnty - v-kitchen-free-qnty > 0
     5387               then do:
